Require xsimd 14, as upstream does after 0.27.1.

xsimd's CMake package accepts only requests for its own major version, so
xtensor 0.27.1's find_package(xsimd 13.2.0) rejects xsimd 14 (the version
ported here and the one QNX ships). Upstream xtensor moved to xsimd 14
right after 0.27.1 with exactly this change (37e4b58, "Upgraded to xsimd 14").

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/xtensor-stack/xtensor/commit/37e4b5813d6df4bbbc8112be1c3fc6eff965792e]

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@
 endif()
 
 if(XTENSOR_USE_XSIMD)
-    set(xsimd_REQUIRED_VERSION 13.2.0)
+    set(xsimd_REQUIRED_VERSION 14.0.0)
     if(TARGET xsimd)
         set(xsimd_VERSION ${XSIMD_VERSION_MAJOR}.${XSIMD_VERSION_MINOR}.${XSIMD_VERSION_PATCH})
         # Note: This is not SEMVER compatible comparison
